# TaxTreat Vercel deployment slimming
# Runtime application + released legal datasets stay included.
# Development, QA, historical evidence and raw acquisition material stay in GitHub,
# but are not uploaded into every Vercel deployment.

# Repository/development-only material
.github/
tests/
scripts/
reports/
docs/
reference_cases/
imports/
alembic/
src/

.coveragerc
requirements-dev.txt
MILESTONES.md
PROJECT_BIBLE.md
README.md
alembic.ini

# Heavy source/review material not read by the production runtime.
data/legal_sources/
data/parsed/
data/legal_consolidation/
data/legal_rule_candidates/
data/audits/
data/extracted/
data/generated/
data/acceptance/
data/golden_cases/

# The historical CZ review workspace is ~21 MB. Production needs only the
# released Stage-6 identity and canonical source gate. Keep SK review material
# intact for now because SK runtime/release checks intentionally consume it.
data/legal_reviews/**
!data/legal_reviews/
!data/legal_reviews/sk_outbound/
!data/legal_reviews/sk_outbound/**
!data/legal_reviews/global_cz_outbound/
!data/legal_reviews/global_cz_outbound/stage6_source_release.json
!data/legal_reviews/global_cz_outbound/production_source_release_gate_v2.json
